flowchart TD
    A[User opens dashboard] --> B2{Any existing booklets?}
    B2 -- No --> C[Show Create your first booklet]
    B2 -- Yes --> D[Show Create a new booklet]
    C --> E[Open agent chat]
    D --> E

    E --> S[User submits a storyline<br/>by text or voice]
    S --> Q[Agent assesses gaps]
    Q --> QD{More information needed<br/>and fewer than 8 questions asked?}
    QD -- Yes --> QC[Show the next relevant<br/>generative UI question card]
    QC --> QA[User answers or accepts<br/>a recommendation]
    QA --> Q
    QD -- No --> P[Generate the whole plot]

    P --> PC[Show editable plot overview card]
    PC --> PD{Plot confirmed?}
    PD -- Edit --> PC
    PD -- Yes --> ST[Show 2 to 5 inventory<br/>style cards]
    ST --> STC[User selects a style]
    STC --> CH[Show suggested inventory<br/>character cards]
    CH --> CHC[User confirms cast and<br/>optional simple edits]

    CHC --> LK[Generate style and character<br/>reference prompts or assets]
    LK --> LKC{Locked references confirmed?}
    LKC -- Edit --> LK
    LKC -- Yes --> CS[Generate character sheet]
    CS --> CSC{Character sheet confirmed?}
    CSC -- Edit --> CSU[Update locked character references]
    CSU --> CS
    CSC -- Yes --> BS[Generate reviewable booklet<br/>specifications card]

    BS --> BSC{Specifications confirmed?}
    BSC -- Edit --> BS
    BSC -- Yes --> FS[Generate cover and full<br/>page-by-page story]
    FS --> FC[Show reviewable cards for cover, text,<br/>setting and props, page layout,<br/>and every panel prompt]
    FC --> FCD{All required cards confirmed?}
    FCD -- Review or edit --> FC
    FCD -- Yes --> GEN[Start mocked asynchronous generation]
    GEN --> DASH[Return to dashboard]
    DASH --> STATUS[Show booklet status: Generating]

    SAVE[Autosave every meaningful change]
    S -.-> SAVE
    QA -.-> SAVE
    PC -.-> SAVE
    STC -.-> SAVE
    CHC -.-> SAVE
    LKC -.-> SAVE
    CSC -.-> SAVE
    BSC -.-> SAVE
    FC -.-> SAVE
